# =============================================================================
# app_cmd_menu() - Front board (case 2 empty argv and menu / main)
# =============================================================================
#
# GENERAL PURPOSE:
# On a real terminal: ignore --json while drawing, print client-side,
# language, sudoers, and self-management, keep server-side reserved,
# run a pick. A finished leaf redisplays this board. An empty line leaves.
# Off a terminal: stop. Zero-cli-verb place lives in app_main. sudoers
